    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a2ecfdb697b684a0dae7f0c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿经过夏季集训，\n已经重新找回自信。",
      "source_fingerprint": "48e606eb2e0418e70366397efcbd7f26dce55884fbaf8fd12eef5921d4dd2782",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d03cf7de233bbbde69ca7c3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了确定自己奔跑的理由是正确的，\n她举步迈向比赛场地。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c3946f46884e8f68ff6b7c788169d636cfb54ff910674185582f973bcabc4af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002411.json",
      "json_path": [
