    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c57621335b9a3b71776ddff3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎来“金鯱赏”当天，\n无声铃鹿展现出前所未有的自在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea97b643ca7106420649a1caaea9788186d0857701e5afa18dc2382afc9e5ff0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9db6503e229a5a934527287",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员鼓励她说，\n要尽情地享受比赛──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1775c1b7c5588389a3690549154889fab87657f628629f686018bde396e38f5b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002412.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d40873532dec108603da8044",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿谨记这句话，\n举步迈向赛场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "64281790212bebf7a3ae5c488023eca7a6617aab3e25517047f40b76676fa4b7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
