      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“宝冢纪念”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fede2576af4001f36b4bf97c8f277f31952ca39b4ee8341355d8f956c51a25e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb0e7002da112c3887446d60",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "会场观众都在讨论“女帝”气槽\n要和“异次元逃亡者”无声铃鹿对决的话题。",
      "source_fingerprint": "49756c7e05df63cd818d4d3ee444e58a269b5280f44a8b88fd1cb55f21b202d1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f619272aaa536e82b41b4cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这样的气氛下……\n两人没多说什么，静静地走向对决的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cba196e8abdab72fe18ea0d62e8e86e480388fa33415ea45915cfae5dd8199c5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ff1f27515f70c1e66e50b72",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向宝冢纪念",
      "source_fingerprint": "4743315d92bef0a1d3815aad5f8b1374f193f12e0416639bccc69a7a0dc88f06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002413.json",
