    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0bca6f406564f56fe2b60e11",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“每日王冠”当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa7022328880514e6f7a44eea3d144260b19926553fe05a2b9b3527a3e06e91",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:272cd76213208c7f0962fb48",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在展开对决之前，\n特别周来向无声铃鹿转达\n神鹰和草上飞要告诉她的话。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddfcbf7c7f71790f5ff2fedd3540c41014305b12c74b54ba0b0ce932fcc189f4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b1348287128ce0d95bd42ba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿收下两人充满激昂的话语，\n带着期待对决的心情前往会场。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1a68bc27b3d356a1a80afdd761a7b82ae4e116b579c66cd1472792039a7703e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17562e86aadb3fab05b0c559",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎向每日王冠",
      "source_fingerprint": "2bf5262ed3986b20778c691267f38a0d2bd5a1ad7f12b2e2579425648349789b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002414.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c512cbe365fb12f471a7826",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于……\n来到“天皇赏（秋）”比赛当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1070d75593b9770a8cd81449335ecb6beab476e0e07a403ab1f4b14982989ac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:867c8768bea7d9413a2c8e23",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在众多比赛中，\n展现出充满魄力的表现，\n让许多粉丝来到会场想亲眼目睹她的风采。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0aec76cff5b3c20cda19fad8b6dc4c3238a452c6fa405331f994cd017f42854",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bdb0517bf2a07e38219d57da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而休息室内却与会场的热闹情绪截然不同，\n充斥着凝重的气氛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "493c0095014486310062f64888e98f57fc874d8a7c538333931181b9d93f45b0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5fb08460c07532c088fa0fc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿告知训练员自己脚部疼痛的状况，\n但希望训练员能够相信她，让她出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "010c0ee176ee4b862334063880340aa4da588789280dc9701de89ae8cf6611fa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c0102952a414c42e6758d0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了往后着想，\n应该是要取消参赛的……\n但训练员选择相信她，允许她出赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88e93914b3c4d6e229a9e0bcf6960686ea1268e3ded893a1ba1fc47e137c5332",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002415.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
