      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑完出道战，\n那片景色深深烙印在无声铃鹿眼底。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4fc772b6b0d3db879dbff10fcb450e992ce77d8e01c06bf8c5db65ddf618b562",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54e410cd40e35aebf53884a1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "光凭这场比赛是无法令她满足的，\n她期盼着能够看到更多更美的景色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3a2741860fc3fbc654ae6b40cf7318436954ac32bdda4a8a01b063dab233cb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b820ca533665a9098f033f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "出道战结束后・迈向未见的景色",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c5144a1d9439e29cdd5bd66edf5937b7c78023ac01fde0c99955ab2f738a54",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:547e45e272f503f36b89c7f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以“皋月赏”为目标的无声铃鹿，\n决定下一场比赛是“弥生赏”，\n开始努力钻研。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e8574deae24e5750a12b6390e97b69581ab31b08bd3854a22fee3efcac347b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a833867fb2fc70929926ba0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这样的过程中，\n训练员接受无声铃鹿的邀请，\n一同前往她常爬的那座山。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df542d95e926d904e1581cdeac6cfb518827b45f4c4b785fd6d83afebf8d4cb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc9b1f2f047a257b8b374c7d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "征服险峻的山路，\n无声铃鹿和训练员都对眼前的景色看得入迷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c63a623ad8fa594190f571af9ff82c8e33916a68e0917888c986c6869fd88892",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d54fd8db5aeb84f0c730a552",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一起共享她喜爱的景色，\n无声铃鹿和训练员之间\n稍微拉近了彼此的心灵距离。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e098cc618907a983a9ebb2ced1e284948602da65c3a80ff4f8f33290f3b801f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e287b6da19aecc6be2d9b19",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目标达成后・秘密基地",
      "source_fingerprint": "78d7401db1a28d1c98b3439b9887d0bfb8bd37626b40c377a9d7aaaa5f1ab161",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002417.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:829b900e34022b73c973034d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在“弥生赏”中，\n也展现出精彩的表现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f45f1863a470c1255445881e0a905c80c3694b7473025014f0946b74ab15fd9a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35f827d6a183236bd0cfab3a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……看到其他赛马娘流下不甘心的泪水，\n她开始烦恼自己奔跑的理由是否正确。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d555bd347b10c87acc8432150160dd3d57731829a46ca82db302b14df7bf8ef",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9002183058ca1ce97696457a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿在这样的状态下，\n认为无法集中精神参加比赛，\n主动提出想要取消参加“皋月赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd934ed27e53fa5b613ba6e5097efc6cf1c768785c0d1ac2da16fc78048b1fda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235a1d2c0777fc0c906520fa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然而没有目标也不是件好事，\n因此训练员将目标改为“神户报杯”，\n鼓励她可以再重新出发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "46df06bb9ebfcb23cc2e7bd66040959ed5763d1e894a5e77d1102844506115ea",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6b18df3d49795f3fb37b7b57",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "弥生赏结束后・心底萌生疑惑",
      "source_fingerprint": "39fa0a15be022deee0da68617fab2d55b073073ce86c4b790ada40bde71ba4ed",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002418.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:811b010f98f43d27c365124f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "跑完“神户报杯”，\n返回训练员身边的无声铃鹿，\n露出舒畅清爽的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31c1505504c81d26764434185ff8e6d8f8c50ebd0c3af43439144a40761d9e09",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ad8a3ce658990d451d7b88c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "下定决心的无声铃鹿，\n提出期望说想要参加“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "996b3f0e6f09419522be5f29918bf7a3fad007028871c90db09bb806793431f3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6756992e72f8e7301b583e76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了让订下重大目标的她能累积经验，\n训练员决定之后要参加“金鯱赏”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fce71c246e1062019c909927a095bd85b657cd32b1b83edf46dfb45f64a32e1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d82a87fa44fc9530556704",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "神户报杯结束后・取回的事物",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3d6a8c47ad333bee834c2cc3f585ee06644fb70efbcd54bd2d626e86c639b9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002419.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b87220bc0130e7a9dc15ba83",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她跑完比赛回来后，\n难得一脸兴奋地说着看到了\n难以忘怀的“美丽景色”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e425dce75b4c497b75575602f9ffceb7dc345f1f6eb57a9865fe6216c6a5b4af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d3d467ac2c24e77856937a8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这场比赛给许多赛马娘带来影响。\n是个点燃她们内心火种的……庞大影响。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c178f237eaa4bc9bfa5eb35634759b0968b438685d33c270a09beffbe6a8141d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6f35184fa516803fa4b952e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "金鯱赏结束后・再起、跃进",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3f082b5434d5735c8401a8ad45b1e7cd0829a305a6c64aa1483adfc3c6106e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002420.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:74d499ecfb5f25718299633b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿称霸了“宝冢纪念”。\n比赛结束后，输掉的气槽赌上尊严，\n希望能有机会再次对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9f3ca86567fdddce4aedd9915a3dc709281dcea33713c6b2d79823bbb82f4422",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f84bdf74951af1532e305dc4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿接受气槽的那份热忱，\n坚定地和她握手。",
      "source_fingerprint": "718f57cf41faf113bf656704fc44baadf12e00315a09e880823ba71b2be18bb3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:213e5386d9246a464c5a43e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "观看了“宝冢纪念”的比赛，\n神鹰和草上飞也点燃斗志，\n为了要向无声铃鹿挑战而有所行动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24fb0bb7208a124e76451b7b32c6c19648391a3c243792f48356904bd6bfd26",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d69430f734c7847522687b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "之后不久就是夏季集训，\n无声铃鹿即将开始新的战斗。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9495b6cf2ef8e81ba83c8647da2f1b4ad11764e6719f40a84129e9246b4f156",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc77d3b6c98b54207711e713",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "宝冢纪念结束后・心跳与光辉",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ef3d0e9f8d451981d670125ccf1c10f19a79c3fda53e9dc1395b4e80654c690",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002421.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8a268822b9891e72ddb0ba9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最后是气槽称霸了“宝冢纪念”。\n然而，无法接受比赛内容的她，\n向无声铃鹿再次下达战帖。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0b2323f4578a09d21e753f1b241279522f2c6e4486a72e03085b809f106ef06",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
