      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a1ff8d9866aeb8c47d7393a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "输了比赛的神鹰和草上飞立誓雪耻，\n决心有日一定要超越无声铃鹿。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dca89ce9822deea71d8db83ef64428e6208ad27e8e7cb4e55e7c0db025a71ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1002/storytimeline_501002423.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3116ca37c5ab0de7377f296",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "见证了这场对决的特别周，\n产生一股强烈想要超越无声铃鹿的念头。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c017a142d1d2cbd132a9f4a834bc8fb999e56a914cd6d1d48c573c67bb4a645",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
