      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:effa5837d90ad14b8e71d2e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无声铃鹿也下定决心说会好好努力，\n让自己不会被特别周超越……\n让人心驰神往的“天皇赏（秋）”就在眼前！",
      "source_fingerprint": "46e27c7fcf2182ea7695f065e503b16b6c4dc106502a473a96f4f5b57697d2c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
