      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东京赛场欢声雷动，\n祝贺她获胜的欢呼声持续了好一阵子，\n久久未停。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b7af43cebba9e6e65ee17d374c28b5a24735896a1c8e767198191017ab14da4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
